#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:1 eedcac90ed2f431fa05bb0c202260656
msgid "Ark / Lift 2s"
msgstr "Ark / Lift 2s"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:3 548d7893eeff418a815614a1df631898
msgid "**Ark (方舟)** is **Lift 2s**: the full-body platform (arms **plus** lift axis and **mobile base / chassis**), not an arm-only robot."
msgstr "**Ark（方舟）** 就是 **Lift 2s**：全身平台（手臂 **加上** 升降轴和 **移动底盘 / 底盘**），不是仅机械臂的机器人。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:5 0fd25f76953b42699f98d88375a5f0cd
msgid "**Acone** is the **arm portion** of the same stack (manipulator only). It is not the Lift 2s platform. The `arx-lift2s` workspace can launch Acone from `quick_start` for co-debug; the product focus of that branch is Lift 2s."
msgstr "**Acone** 是同一套栈中的 **机械臂部分**（仅操作臂）。它不是 Lift 2s 整机。`arx-lift2s` 工作空间可在 `quick_start` 中启动 Acone 做联调；该分支的产品重点是 Lift 2s。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:7 a02d6c2e88d94e31afbf8eb11ada13c5
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "以源仓库为准"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:10 918d93357313449286c85b808c0c78ef
msgid "Follow the branch README. Do not invent extra launch flags."
msgstr "遵循分支 README。不要编造额外的 launch 参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:12 df85de52f3a142269a50c49a861865f6
msgid "Chinese: [open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"
msgstr "中文：[open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:13 91f09450029546c99216e9fb71e43c9e
msgid "English: [README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)"
msgstr "英文：[README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:16 0c25c949f2a043a2a248e6cf5d628fa6
msgid "Clone and init"
msgstr "克隆与初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:18 49e370da54bd4dca90433e528eafbd3a
msgid "From the README (directory name `lift2s-ws` is the example):"
msgstr "来自 README（目录名 `lift2s-ws` 为示例）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:20 86d87ef9fdbe4b89876cba3a3002b2da
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:27 3489cabd234f43378ef2443afdfe6307
msgid "Field zip (README): unzip, then `./release.sh --install`, then `./quick_start.sh`. Descriptions stay as source; controllers / hardware interface come from `.deb`."
msgstr "现场 zip（README）：解压后执行 `./release.sh --install`，再执行 `./quick_start.sh`。描述保持源码；控制器 / 硬件接口来自 `.deb`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:29 a605443805a5474882721e19b0e66482
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:31 0e5a1e87a465473ebdafcbf089f02646
msgid "Primary path is `./quick_start.sh` (scenario build + Lift2S split/full body, simulation or real):"
msgstr "主路径是 `./quick_start.sh`（按场景编译 + Lift2S 分身/全身，仿真或真机）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:33 660c305fec4b427cb56fac1cb3e37bba
msgid ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:38 062f309736374d3faa12e40e01141b7e
msgid "README menu:"
msgstr "README 菜单："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:40 6b80d2ad58514407a2aef58336ec71da
msgid "**Build** — simulation packages, or real-hardware packages (includes `arx_ros2_control`)"
msgstr "**编译** — 仿真软件包，或真机软件包（含 `arx_ros2_control`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:41 15941a579b1d41bb8341d376282691df
msgid "**Launch** — choose **Lift2S**, then **split body** or **full body**, then simulation (`mock_components`) or **real hardware**"
msgstr "**启动** — 选择 **Lift2S**，再选 **分身** 或 **全身**，然后仿真（`mock_components`）或 **真机**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:43 02e7cfaaf9e344a8979e9d93b2bcc8c9
msgid "CAN (README): left/right arms `can1` / `can3`; no network IP. Lift axis defaults to `hybrid` (change to `soft_p` in `quick_start`)."
msgstr "CAN（README）：左右臂 `can1` / `can3`；没有网络 IP。升降轴默认 `hybrid`（可在 `quick_start` 中改为 `soft_p`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:45 b1d4321870bc4087b9d2a5fea9943838
msgid "X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S in the same menu are `robot-descriptions-arx` models for **co-debug**. Pick **ACone** only when you want the **arm**, not the full Lift 2s chassis."
msgstr "同一菜单中的 X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S 是用于 **联调** 的 `robot-descriptions-arx` 模型。只有在需要 **机械臂**、而不是完整 Lift 2s 底盘时才选 **ACone**。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:47 53d3551888874f96b4fbd57de5049498
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:49 c148e4bfcb144b8e9907f6ec43b62f9b
msgid "Prefer the script. These are the README’s optional equivalents for **Lift2S**:"
msgstr "优先用脚本。以下是 README 中 **Lift2S** 的可选等价命令："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:51 1967bc6a4d0e4ad3a84c5650ecf50feb
msgid ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"
msgstr ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-ark_lift2s.md:60 7091f9e4cd2e44e98be1ec22e662d7d7
msgid "Zenoh: README asks for `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and `export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` on the deploy host."
msgstr "Zenoh：README 要求在部署主机上执行 `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 并 `export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`。"

